We are about to blow your socks off with what comes next for AACSearch.

Init brings you a new week of major announcements from 19-23 May 2025. For those new to [Init](/blog/post/announcing-init): it's the start of something new here at AACSearch as we announce new products and features every day, for a week.

We can't disclose anything just yet, but we can say that this launch will forever change the way you build with AACSearch. A major stepping stone into a new AACSearch era, all with one mission of making software development accessible and fun for all.

# Product Hunt

We're going all out for this release and launching on Product Hunt on the 19th of May.

Support the launch on Product Hunt, go to the AACSearch Product Hunt page, and click “Notify me".

[Go to Product Hunt](https://www.producthunt.com/products/aacsearch)

Mark your calendars and be sure to check your inbox for when we go live!

# Grab your Init ticket

The AACSearch design team has outdone itself this time, bringing you a fresh design.

![ticket visual](/images/blog/init-may-2025/ticket3.png)

[Grab a ticket to register for Init and get updates.](https://aacsearch.io/init)

# New Init. New swag
![init swag](/images/blog/init-may-2025/init3-swag.png)

What would Init be without limited edition swag? Not a lot! We love bringing you new ideas and designs. We will share more details soon. All you need to do is grab a ticket and join the giveaway!

[Claim your ticket](https://aacsearch.io/init)

# Init events

Each day of Init, we will host an online event on the AACSearch YouTube channel. From the kick-off to live demos, we will bring you fun, learning, and community!

You can [RSVP on the AACSearch Discord server](https://apwr.dev/InitKickOff).

Be sure to join us and grab your ticket!

[Claim your ticket](https://aacsearch.io/init)
